{"metadata":{"description":"Galgame Doctor: reuse translations after game updates, review conflicts in CSV, import approved text, and verify patches.","id":"gh:1335957656","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-galgame-localization-reverse","slug":"julescules/dsh-galgame-localization-reverse","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-plugin","dsh-plugin","galgame","game-localization","kirikiri","localization","renpy","reverse-engineering","reverse-engineering-tools","rollback","translation-memory","translation-qa","visual-novel","visual-novel-localization","visual-novel-translation","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Galgame Doctor: reuse translations after game updates, review conflicts in CSV, import approved text"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", and verify patches."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Galgame Doctor for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"New in v0.9.1: review import errors identify the physical CSV record start line, including multiline"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" records and blank lines. Encoding failures do not echo the translation. Provider registration and s"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"kill-body loading were also verified with DSH 0.2.1-rc.3."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Preflight reviewed translations with --dry-run before importing: validate hashes, placeholders, enco"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ding, and strict CSV syntax without writing a catalog."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Keep reviewed translations when a game updates. Catch broken control codes before shipping.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Starting point | Result |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| An unfamiliar game folder | Engine candidates with concrete evidence and a next-step plan |
| Old "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"translations + new scripts | Exact reuse, conflict report, and a human review queue |
| A completed "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"review spreadsheet | Hash-checked JSONL with only explicitly reviewed targets applied |
| A candidat"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"e patch | Translation, encoding, asset, and rollback checks |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### New in v0.9.0: bring human review back into the workflow"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. Run translation-memory migration with `--review-csv review.csv`.
2. Open the CSV in Excel/WPS and"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" fill only `reviewed_target` for rows you approve.
3. Import against the **original current catalog*"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"* used by migration:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The importer rejects a changed catalog, duplicate or unknown IDs, broken placeholders, encoding fail"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ures, and conflicting existing translations. It writes a new file only after every row validates. Bl"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ank reviewed targets remain pending. Default `segment_id`, `source`, and `target` fields are support"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" reviewed targets remain pending. Default `segment_id`, `source`, and `target` fields are supported."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Run migration again with `reviewed.jsonl` as current to combine human decisions with historical exac"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"t reuse, then run strict QA before script writeback. Source game files are never changed by the revi"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"n run strict QA before script writeback. Source game files are never changed by the review importer."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Preflight before import"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Preflight rejects `--output` and writes no files. In its JSON result, `ready` counts filled, validat"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ed review rows; `pending` counts blank review rows; `applied` is always zero. These are review-queue"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" counts, not whole-game completion metrics. Any failed row produces a nonzero exit status. After val"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"idation, replace `--dry-run` with `--output reviewed.jsonl` to import into a new file."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[](https://dshbase.com/plugins/dsh-galgame-localization-reverse/) [](https://github.com/julescules/d"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"sh-galgame-localization-reverse/actions/workflows/ci.yml)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]
> Unofficial community plugin. Independently developed and maintained; not reviewed o"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"r endorsed by DeepSeek."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Audit first, reuse safely, localize second. Give DeepSeek Harness a visual-novel folder and get an e"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"vidence-backed engine candidate, safe translation migration, encoding clues, strict QA, and a revers"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ible next step. The audit is offline and read-only; only report paths outside the audited tree are w"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"xt step. The audit is offline and read-only; only report paths outside the audited tree are written."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Start in 30 seconds"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart DSH, then ask:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"No API key is required. The plugin contains no game assets, decrypted archives, credentials, or titl"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"quired. The plugin contains no game assets, decrypted archives, credentials, or title-specific keys."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### One-command localization plan"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`vn_project_audit.py plan` inventories a bounded set of files and reports:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- engine candidates with confidence, signal groups, and concrete path evidence;
- script, archive, i"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"mage, font, and executable candidates;
- bounded encoding samples and CJK-path-safe relative paths;
"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"- a cautious classification of `candidate`, `weak-candidate`, or `unknown`;
- an evidence status, re"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"commended route, exact next commands, risks, and release gates."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The classification is routing evidence, not a claim that static inspection proves runtime behavior."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Lossless source-script adapters"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`vn_script_adapter.py` extracts plain KiriKiri `.ks`, Ren'Py `.rpy`, and NScripter `0.txt` text into"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" UTF-8 JSONL while preserving source hash, line hash, path, line number, encoding, BOM, newline, pre"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"fix, and suffix. Apply always writes to a separate output root and fails if the source changed."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"It does not open XP3/NSA archives or claim compiled-script support."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Safe translation migration after game updates"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"`vn_translation_memory.py` carries reviewed translations from one or more prior releases into a newl"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"y extracted catalog without silently guessing. Repeat `--previous` to combine histories. Exact confl"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"icts across releases stay empty and return a non-zero status; fuzzy matches remain review-only. Ever"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"y input remains unchanged and every catalog SHA-256 is recorded. The optional UTF-8 BOM CSV opens cl"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"eanly in Excel/WPS and keeps blank reviewer columns for decisions."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Strict translation preflight"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"`vn_qa.py` rejects missing, added, or reordered control tokens by default. v3 adds glossary and forb"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"idden-term gates, repeated-source consistency, character/line budgets, punctuation balance, empty tr"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"anslations, residual Japanese, and target-encoding checks. Generic JSON/JSONL, script-adapter JSONL,"},{"id":"p39s4","text":" and GalTransl cache fields are supported without third-party packages."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"An intentionally broken synthetic fixture produces a concise failure report:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### Release evidence, not another translator"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The bundled workflow also provides:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- `vn_patch.py` — hash-bound file replacement, verification, backup, and rollback;
- `vn_image_qa.py"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"` — PNG/APNG, JPEG, GIF, and BMP geometry/alpha/frame comparison;
- `vn_slot_qa.py` — fixed-slot ter"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"minator, padding, marker, and outside-region checks;
- focused routes for AI6WIN, BGI/Ethornell, Dir"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"ector, RealLive, Delphi/DirectDraw, PSP/Vita, Ren'Py, KiriKiri, and custom engines."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}
